================================================================================
Third-party dependencies
================================================================================

None. BLRCS is implemented using only the Go standard library and the
crypto/ed25519 package shipped with the Go toolchain. There are no vendored or
external module dependencies.

================================================================================
Standards implemented
================================================================================

This implementation targets the following public specifications. These are
referenced for interoperability; no specification text is reproduced here.

  - W3C Verifiable Credentials Data Model 2.0
  - W3C Bitstring Status List v1.0
  - W3C Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs) 1.0 (did:web, did:key, did:jwk)
  - W3C Digital Credentials API
  - IETF SD-JWT VC (draft-ietf-oauth-sd-jwt-vc)
  - IETF SCITT Architecture; RFC 6962 (Merkle inclusion/consistency proofs)
  - IETF RFC 9264 (Linkset)
  - OpenID for Verifiable Presentations 1.0 (DCQL)
  - OpenID for Verifiable Credential Issuance
  - GS1 Digital Link
  - OpenTelemetry Semantic Conventions

